### 3. Conversion Funnel

The conversion funnel measures the progression from signup to verification and first purchase.

**Stages:**

```text
Signups
   ↓
Email Verified
   ↓
First Purchase
```

**Metrics:**

```text
Signups = COUNT(*)

Verified Users =
COUNT(CASE WHEN email_verified_at IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END)

First Purchases =
COUNT(CASE WHEN first_transaction_at IS NOT NULL THEN 1 END)
```

**Conversion Rate:**

```text
Conversion % =
First Purchases / Signups × 100
```

**SQL:**

```sql
SELECT
    DATE_TRUNC('day', created_at)::DATE AS signup_date,
    COUNT(*) AS signups,
    COUNT(
        CASE
            WHEN email_verified_at IS NOT NULL THEN 1
        END
    ) AS verified,
    COUNT(
        CASE
            WHEN first_transaction_at IS NOT NULL THEN 1
        END
    ) AS first_purchase,
    ROUND(
        100.0 * COUNT(
            CASE
                WHEN first_transaction_at IS NOT NULL THEN 1
            END
        ) / NULLIF(COUNT(*), 0),
        1
    ) AS conversion_pct
FROM users
GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('day', created_at)
ORDER BY signup_date DESC;
```

