## Metric Consistency

Business metrics should have one clearly defined calculation.

Instead of different analysts recreating the same metric in separate notebooks, the SQL definition can be stored and reused.

For example:

```text
Monthly Active Users
= COUNT(DISTINCT customer_id)
```

Using a consistent definition helps prevent different teams from reporting different values for the same business metric.

